Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

## Why this licence

This repository is method rather than software: role specifications, department
contracts, skills, workflows and templates. CC BY-SA is the licence that fits
that shape — it keeps the method reusable and adaptable while requiring that
improvements stay available on the same terms.

It matches the documentation licence used by the companion Home Lab repository,
which applies MIT to code and CC BY-SA 4.0 to documentation.

Any executable code added to this repository later should carry MIT alongside
this, and that split should be recorded when it happens.
